"{\"reasoning\":\"INFEASIBLE: To achieve 100\u202fMHz GBW with CL=5\u202fpF requires gm\u22483.14\u202fmS. With the power budget (\u2264100\u202f\u00b5W) the tail current cannot exceed \u224815\u202f\u00b5A, giving Id\u22487.5\u202f\u00b5A per input device and thus gm/Id\u2248420\u202fV\u207b\u00b9, far above the allowed 4\u201124\u202fV\u207b\u00b9 range. Consequently the required gain and GBW cannot be met within the power limit.\",\"gmid1\":24,\"L1_um\":0.28,\"gmid3\":24,\"L3_um\":0.28,\"gmid5\":24,\"L5_um\":0.28,\"Itail_uA\":15}"